{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) a<sup>5</sup> + 4a এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) a<sup>2</sup> - 2a - 2", "option2": "খ) a<sup>2</sup> + 2a - 2", "option3": "গ) a<sup>2</sup> - 2a + 2", "option4": "ঘ) a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a<sup>5</sup> + 4a<br />= a(a<sup>4</sup> + 4)<br />= a{(a<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2<sup>2</sup>}<br />= a{(a<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - 2.a<sup>2</sup>.2}<br />= a{(a<sup>2</sup> + 2)<sup>2</sup> - (2a)<sup>2</sup>}<br />= a(a<sup>2</sup> + 2a + 2)(a<sup>2</sup> - 2a + 2)</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>2</sup> এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x + 2", "option2": "খ) x - 2", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x + 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>4</sup> - x<sup>2</sup><br />= x<sup>2</sup>(x<sup>2</sup> - 1)<br />= x<sup>2</sup>(x + 1)(x - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> - 2y - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x - y - 1", "option2": "খ) x - y + 1", "option3": "গ) x + y - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x + y + 2", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - y<sup>2</sup> - 2y - 1<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - (y<sup>2</sup> + 2y + 1)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - (y + 1)<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + y + 1)(x - y - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) x<sup>4</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> + 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> + x + 2", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>4</sup>&nbsp;+ x<sup>2</sup> + 1<br />= {(x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 2.x<sup>2</sup>.1 + 1<sup>2</sup>} - x<sup>2</sup><br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + 1)<sup>2</sup> - x<sup>2</sup><br />= (x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) x<sup>2</sup> - 2bx + (a + b)(b - a) এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x + a + b", "option2": "খ) x - a + b", "option3": "গ) x + a - b", "option4": "ঘ) x - a<sup>2</sup> - b<sup>2</sup>", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - 2bx + (a + b)(b - a)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 2bx + (b + a)(b - a)<br />= x<sup>2</sup> - 2bx + b<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup><br />= (x - b)<sup>2</sup> - a<sup>2</sup><br />= (x + a - b)(x - a - b)</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) x<sup>2</sup> + 5x - 6 এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x + 1", "option2": "খ) x - 6", "option3": "গ) -x - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x - 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup>+ 5x - 6<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + 6x - x - 6<br />= x(x + 6) -1(x + 6)<br />= (x +6)(x - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 2 এর উৎপাদক কোনটি -", "option1": "ক) x + 2", "option2": "খ) x - 2", "option3": "গ) x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x + 3", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + x - 2<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - x - 2<br />= x(x + 2) - 1(x + 2)<br />= (x + 2)(x - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) 4x<sup>2</sup> - 13x - 12 এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x + 4", "option2": "খ) x - 4", "option3": "গ) 4x - 3", "option4": "ঘ) 3x + 4", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>4x<sup>2</sup> - 13x - 12<br />= 4x<sup>2</sup> - 16x + 3x - 12<br />= 4x(x - 4) + 3(x - 4)<br />= (x - 4)(4x + 3)</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 2x<sup>2</sup> - xy - 6y<sup>2</sup> এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) 2x +2y", "option2": "খ) x + 2y", "option3": "গ) x - 2y", "option4": "ঘ) 2x - 3y", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>2x<sup>2</sup> - xy - 6y<sup>2</sup><br />= 2x<sup>2</sup> - 4xy + 3xy -6y<sup>2</sup><br />= 2x(x - 2y) + 3y(x - 2y)<br />= (x - 2y)(2x + 3y)</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 240 এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x - 16", "option2": "খ) x + 15", "option3": "গ) x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x - 15", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + x - 240<br />= x<sup>2</sup> + 16x - 15x - 240<br />= x(x + 16) -15(x + 16)<br />= (x + 16)(x - 15)</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) x - 5, x<sup>2</sup> + 7x + p এর একটি উৎপাদক হলে p = ?", "option1": "ক) -60", "option2": "খ) -30", "option3": "গ