ে k = ?", "option1": "ক) -1", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x - 3, f(x) = x<sup>3</sup> + kx<sup>2</sup> - 6x - 9 এর উৎপাদক<br />&there4; f(3) = 27 + 9k - 18 - 9 = 9k = 0<br />&there4; k = 0</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) x<sup>6</sup> - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 6", "option2": "খ) x<sup>2</sup> - x - 1", "option3": "গ) x<sup>2</sup> + x - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>6</sup> - 1<br />= (x<sup>3</sup>)<sup>2</sup> - 1<sup>2</sup><br />= (x<sup>3</sup> + 1)(x<sup>3</sup> - 1)<br />= (x + 1)(x<sup>2</sup> - x + 1)(x - 1)(x<sup>2</sup> + x + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) x<sup>2</sup> + 2ax - 2a - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) x - 2a - 1", "option2": "খ) x - 2a + 1", "option3": "গ) x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) x - 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 2ax - 2a - 1<br />= (x<sup>2</sup> - 1) + 2ax - 2a<br />= (x + 1)(x - 1) + 2a (x - 1)<br />= (x - 1)(x + 2a + 1)</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) 4x<sup>4</sup> + 1 এর উৎপাদক -", "option1": "ক) 2x<sup>2</sup> + 1", "option2": "খ) 2x<sup>2</sup> - 1", "option3": "গ) 2x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1", "option4": "ঘ) 2x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 1", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>4x<sup>4</sup> + 1<br />= (2x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> + 1<br />= (2x<sup>2</sup> + 1)<sup>2</sup> - 2.2x<sup>2</sup>.1<br />= (2x<sup>2</sup> + 1)<sup>2</sup> - (2x)<sup>2</sup><br />= (2x<sup>2</sup> + 2x + 1) (2x<sup>2</sup> - 2x + 1)</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1200000, "pk": 2478, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 2478}